<title>POLAND: JUTRZENKA APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 0.83 MLN.</title>
<headline>JUTRZENKA APRIL NET RISES TO PLN 0.83 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results April</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> APRIL		    1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     0.83 vs   0.61</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.26 vs   0.94</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.36 vs   1.07</p>
<p> Sales		   11.71 vs   8.08</p>
<p> JANUARY-APRIL	  1997     1996</p>
<p> Net profit	     5.16 vs   3.92</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 7.55 vs   5.93</p>
<p> Operating profit     8.05 vs   6.40</p>
<p> Sales		   48.50 vs  38.17</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish confectionary firm is</p>
<p>Przedsiebiorstwo Cukiernicze Jutrzenka SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
